        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>荔枝地理 - 时事热点综合练习</title>\n<script>\n  window.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] } };\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", serif;\n    background-color: #fdfdfb;\n    background-image:\n      linear-gradient(rgba(200,200,220,0.35) 1px, transparent 1px),\n      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(200,200,220,0.35) 1px, transparent 1px);\n    background-size: 20px 20px;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    color: #222;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n  }\n  .page {\n    max-width: 700px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 20px 30px 40px 30px;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .header {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #999;\n    padding-bottom: 6px;\n    margin-bottom: 14px;\n    font-size: 13px;\n  }\n  .question-block {\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n  .options-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n    gap: 2px 10px;\n    margin: 4px 0 10px 10px;\n  }\n  .para {\n    margin: 10px 0;\n    text-align: justify;\n    text-indent: 2em;\n  }\n  .images-row {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: flex-start;\n    align-items: flex-end;\n    gap: 10px;\n    margin: 10px 0 4px 0;\n  }\n  .fig-block {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    border: 1px solid #888;\n    background: #fafafa;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    color: #666;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .fig8 { width: 170px; height: 130px; }\n  .fig9 { width: 150px; height: 130px; }\n  .fig10 { width: 110px; height: 130px; }\n  .fig-caption {\n    font-size: 12px;\n    margin-top: 2px;\n  }\n  .russia-title {\n    display: inline-block;\n    border: 1.5px solid #d33;\n    color: #d33;\n    padding: 2px 14px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    margin: 16px 0 10px 0;\n  }\n  .page-number {\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-top: 30px;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    color: #333;\n  }\n  .circled {\n    display: inline-block;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"header\">\n    <span>荔枝地理</span>\n    <span>时事热点综合练习</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"question-block\">\n    <div>12. 读图判断多的气候类型为（　　）</div>\n    <div class=\"options-grid\">\n      <div>A．热带草原气候</div>\n      <div>B．热带雨林气候</div>\n      <div>C．热带沙漠气候</div>\n      <div>D．热带季风气候</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"para\">\n    2022 年 11 月 21 日至 12 月 18 日，第 22 届世界杯足球寡在卡塔尔举办。从场馆建设到纪念品生产，中国制造随处可见。图 8 为西亚地区图，图 9 为卡塔尔首都多哈气温曲线和降水量柱状图，图 10 为第 22 届世界杯足球寨吉祥物\"拉伊卜\"。读图，完成 13－15 题。\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"images-row\">\n    <div class=\"fig-block\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder fig8\">[Map: 西亚地区，含标注\"沙特阿拉伯\"、\"卡塔尔\"、\"阿拉伯联合酋长国\"等]</div>\n      <div class=\"fig-caption\">图 8</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"fig-block\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder fig9\">[Chart: 气温曲线与降水量柱状图，纵轴气温℃/降水量mm，横轴1-12月]</div>\n      <div class=\"fig-caption\">图 9</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"fig-block\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder fig10\">[Photo: 世界杯吉祥物\"拉伊卜\"，白色头巾造型人偶踩足球]</div>\n      <div class=\"fig-caption\">图 10</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"question-block\">\n    <div>13．通常世界杯在 6、7 月举办，而卡塔尔世界杯选择在 11－12 月举办的主要原因是（　　）</div>\n    <div class=\"options-grid\">\n      <div>A．降水最多</div>\n      <div>B．气温较低</div>\n      <div>C．光照强烈</div>\n      <div>D．昼长夜短</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"question-block\">\n    <div>14．吉祥物\"拉伊卜\"的设计灵感来自于当地传统服饰，反映当地的自然环境特征是（　　）</div>\n    <div>① 海拔高 ② 气温高 ③ 光照强 ④ 风沙大</div>\n    <div class=\"options-grid\">\n      <div>A．①②③</div>\n      <div>B．①②④</div>\n      <div>C．①③④</div>\n      <div>D．②③④</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"question-block\">\n    <div>15．我国与卡塔尔的合作可以（　　）</div>\n    <div class=\"options-grid\">\n      <div><span style=\"border:1.5px solid #d33; padding:0 2px;\">A．消除经济差异</span></div>\n      <div>B．体现南北对话</div>\n      <div>C．实现互惠互利</div>\n      <div>D．缩短运输距离</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"russia-title\">俄罗斯</div>\n\n  <div class=\"para\">\n    2023 年 3 月 20 日至 22 日，国家主席习近平对俄罗斯进行国事访问。读俄罗斯示意图，完成 16－17 小题。\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"page-number\">4</div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
